<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Blyvooruitzicht Sept qtr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Blyvooruitzicht Sept qtr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  11.40 vs  9.69</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   2.51 vs  1.08</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Underground			 258,000 vs 251,000</p>
<p>	- Surface			     687,000 vs 714,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			   1,384 vs 1,507</p>
<p>	- Surface				   480 vs   480</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Underground			    5.36 vs 6.00</p>
<p>	- Surface				  0.70 vs 0.67</p>
<p>Cost (rand/kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			  58,577 vs 49,898</p>
<p>	- Surface				24,016 vs 24,783</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			54,554 vs 48,080</p>
<p>Full name: Blyvooruitzicht Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
